meta {
  name: List Connections
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/connections
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Every configured target-database connection, for editing. Credentials are replaced by `passwordSet` / `uriSet` flags — true whenever a secret is stored, even one that no longer decrypts (lost key file), since restoring the key revives it. Connections live in the app database; `DBFORGE_CONNECTIONS` seeds it once, the first time it has connections to import.

  Requires a valid Bearer JWT ({{token}}).
  **Admin only.**
}
